when clicked
set [score v] to (0)
show variable [score v]
switch costume to [cookie v]

when this sprite clicked
change [score v] by (1)
start sound [pop v]
switch costume to [pressed v]
wait (0.1) seconds
switch costume to [cookie v]
if <(score) = (10)> then
  switch backdrop to [win v]
  broadcast [win v]
end
